footer
Source-reviewed orchestration. Nested semantics remain open; no runtime acceptance
claimed. Complete verifier and finite tool map reviewed: Python, C/C++,
JavaScript/TypeScript, Rust, Go, Bash, Ruby, PHP, Java, C#, CUDA, Fortran, Swift, Zig,
LLVM, ISPC, NASM and assembly, plus in-process JSON. Julia/Kotlin aliases can have a
